    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya mambo gaga kuhendeka, nyo vilongozi anilunga achiamba, “Aha Aiziraeli phamwenga na alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi taakadzitenga bii na nyo atu a mataifa ganjina asagalao kpwenye tsi ihi. Ahenda mambo ga kutsukiza dza nyo Akanani, Ahiti, Aperizi, Ajebusi, Aamoni, Amoabu, Amisiri na Aamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ao alóla asichana a mataifa gaga na ana aho a chilume achialoza ana achetu a mataifa higo. Kpwa sababu iyo atsanganya chivyazi chitakatifu na atu a mataifa gago. Na nyo vilongozi aho na maliwali ndio ariokala msitari wa mbere kpwa kukosa uaminifu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niriphosikira gago, nákpwanyula vwazi rangu na joho rangu. Nchimwafula nyere na cheru changu, nchisagala na kudangana kpwa sonono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nyo atu arioondoswa ni maneno ga Mlungu wa Iziraeli kuhusu ro kosa ra nyo atu ariouya kula Babeli, akusanyika na achinizunguluka. Nami násagala na nchidangana kpwa sonono hadi wakati wa kulavya sadaka za dziloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriphofika wakati wa kulavya sadaka za dziloni náunuka kula pho ambapho kala nisegere kula ligundzu kpwa sonono kuno vwazi rangu na joho rangu ambazo kala nkazikpwanyula kare. Náchita mavwindi na nchiunula mikono yangu dzulu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Návoya nchiamba, “Ee Mlungu wangu, nina haya kuunula uso wangu mberezo, mana uyi wehu ni munji hadi ukahutsupa vitswa na makosa gehu gakazidi hadi gakafika hiko dzulu mlunguni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula siku za akare ehu hadi rero makosa gehu gakakala manji. Kpwa sababu ya uyi wehu swiswi, afalume ehu na alavyadzi-sadaka ehu, hwatiywa mikononi mwa afalume a tsi za chijeni, anjina ehu huchiolagbwa na upanga, huchihalwa mateka, huchifutwa mali zehu na huchiaibishwa dza irivyo rero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela vivi, Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu, ukahuonera mbazi kpwa uhu muda mfupi, nawe ukahusaza na kuhupha usalama kahi za phatupho phatakatifu. Ukahupha tumaini na kuhuoyeza utumwa wehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzagbwe swiswi kala hu atumwa, uwe Mlungu wehu kuhurichire bii kahi za utumwa wehu. Ukahuonyesa mendzwaye isiyosika mbere za afalume a Pashia. Ukahutiya nguvu luphya huidzenge nyumbayo ambayo kala ikakala gandzo. Chisha ukakala ukuta wa kuhurinda hipha Juda na Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Haya vino huambedze Mlungu wehu bada ya gano? Mana hukaricha malagizogo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "urigogalavya kutsupira atumishio manabii uchiamba, ‘Yo tsi ambayo munaphiya mkaihale ikale yenu ni tsi ambayo yatiywa najisi. Atu asagalao mumo akayoodzaza mahendo ga kutsukiza kula pembe ya tsi hadi pembe ya tsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.11+EXO.34.12+EXO.34.13+EXO.34.14+EXO.34.15+EXO.34.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 34:11–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.1+DEU.7.2+DEU.7.3+DEU.7.4+DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 7:1–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo msilavye asichana enu alólwe ni ahana aho na musiriche ahana enu alóle ana achetu ao. Musiike mapatano nao wala kulonda usena nao, ili mkale na nguvu, na murye manono ga yo tsi na kuricha yo tsi ikale urisi wa vivyazi vyenu hata kare na kare.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaga gachigohuphaha ni kpwa sababu ya mahendo gehu mai na makosa gehu, alafu Mlungu wehu, adabu uriyohupha ni ndide kulengana na go makosa gehu garivyofwaha kutiywa adabu, chisha ukahusaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hundawezadze tsona kuvundza amuriyo na kulungana na atu ahendao mambo mai ambago ni tsukizo kpwako? Dze, kundahutsukirirwa na kuhubananga-bananga bila kuhusaza au kutivya hata mutu mmwenga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Mwenyezi Mlungu wa Iziraeli, uwe u mwenye haki. Siswi hu masaza huriotiya. Huimire mberezo swiswi enye dambi, dzagbwe taphana hata mmwenga wehu afwahaye kuima mberezo kpwa sababu ya makosa gehu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
